sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Streamlit app
    participant Client as MCP worker
    participant CLI as adversal-cli
    participant Backend as Adversal backend

    User->>App: Submit upload or URL + analysis controls
    App->>Client: Queue process_video(...)
    Client->>CLI: Call through persistent MCP session
    CLI->>Backend: Upload and start remote analysis
    Backend-->>CLI: request_id
    CLI-->>Client: SUCCESS + request_id
    Client-->>App: Parsed request_id
    App->>App: Persist RUNNING job

    loop Every 8 seconds
        CLI->>Backend: Background poll and artifact extraction
        App->>Client: Queue check_video_status(request_id)
        Client->>CLI: Reuse same MCP session
        CLI-->>App: RUNNING / COMPLETED / FAILED / UNKNOWN
    end

    opt Authentication required
        App-->>User: Keep authentication banner active
        User->>App: Complete browser OAuth
        App->>Client: Queue authenticate()
        Client->>CLI: Require AUTHENTICATED response
    end

    App-->>User: Workspace, failure, or retry same request ID
